[ti:29. Come In, Amy]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:00.670]Lesson 29. | 第29课。
[00:03.710]Come in, Bessie. | 进来，贝西。
[00:07.410]Shut /ʃʌt/ the door, please. | 请关上门。
[00:11.450]This bedroom /ˈbedruːm/'s very untidy /ʌnˈtaɪdi/. | 这卧室很凌乱。
[00:14.610]What must I do, Mrs. Jones? | 琼斯夫人，我该做什么？
[00:18.730]Open /ˈəʊpən/ the window and air /eə/ the room. | 打开窗户，让房间通风。
[00:23.630]Then put /pʊt/ these clothes /kləʊðz/ in the wardrobe /ˈwɔːdrəʊb/. | 然后把这些衣服放进衣柜。
[00:28.430]Then make the bed. | 然后铺床。
[00:31.750]Dust /dʌst/ the dressing table /ˈdresɪŋ teɪbl/. | 掸掉梳妆台的灰尘。
[00:35.310]Then sweep /swiːp/ the floor /flɔː/. | 然后扫地。